{"4932130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms With Friends!", "steam_appid": 4932130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5018470], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You noclipped out of reality. Now you're somewhere else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms With Friends!</strong> is a 1-5 player co-op horror game set in the endless halls of the Backrooms. Levels are procedurally generated, so no run is ever quite the same, and no run is ever fully safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore.</strong> Every level is generated fresh, so you can never fully memorize your way through the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge.</strong> Search the halls for items and supplies you'll need to survive and keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve.</strong> Some doors won't open for the reckless. Work with your team to solve puzzles standing between you and the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive.</strong> Entities stalk the halls, drawn to sound and stragglers. Some can be outrun. Some can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together. Communication is your best tool down here. Get separated, and you might not make it back. Get caught, and you won't make it out at all.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You noclipped out of reality. Now you're somewhere else.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms With Friends!</strong> is a 1-5 player co-op horror game set in the endless halls of the Backrooms. Levels are procedurally generated, so no run is ever quite the same, and no run is ever fully safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore.</strong> Every level is generated fresh, so you can never fully memorize your way through the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge.</strong> Search the halls for items and supplies you'll need to survive and keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve.</strong> Some doors won't open for the reckless. Work with your team to solve puzzles standing between you and the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive.</strong> Entities stalk the halls, drawn to sound and stragglers. Some can be outrun. Some can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together. Communication is your best tool down here. Get separated, and you might not make it back. Get caught, and you won't make it out at all.</p>", "short_description": "A 1-5 player co-op horror game where you and your friends noclip into an endless maze also known as the Backrooms. Explore procedurally generated levels and avoid the Entities that stalk the halls. Get separated and you might not make it back. Get caught and you won't make it out at all...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932130/db13e4cf976ac79596d3c6f18c9ec3192df7bd33/header.jpg?t=1786305717", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932130/c6ef47fe721b8cc23b463a8408f57387e1f28b62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786305717", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932130/c6ef47fe721b8cc23b463a8408f57387e1f28b62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786305717", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600X / Intel Core i5-10600K<br></li